<title>USA: Brandywine to buy four office properties.</title>
<headline>Brandywine to buy four office properties.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON SQUARE, Pa. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust said on Friday it entered into an agreement to buy four commercial office properties in suburban Philadelphia for a $22.8 million cash.</p>
<p>The properties had an aggregate 242,000 net rentable square feet, the company said.</p>
<p>The transaction was subject to the usual closing conditions, it added.</p>
